Spec: Independent JVM server lease receiver

Purpose:
  Execute the portable Agent receiver against standard tokens signed by the separately built Go issuer.

Owns:
  ./AuthorityClient.java

Must:
  Read only public certificates and fixture tokens, reject signed malformed inputs and preserve fixed rejection errors.
  Verify shared-clock expiry, replay, late higher sequences, rollback and permanently closed control generations.
  Report counts only, without token contents or private key export.
